message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite both the software and the
  related manuscript.
type: software
title: 'Coverage versus within-epoch repetition at matched dose in transformer grokking: code and data'
authors:
  - family-names: Tan
    given-names: Chang
    affiliation: Dalian University of Technology
    email: aquars43@foxmail.com
repository-code: 'https://github.com/43aquarius/NeuralProcessingLetters'
abstract: >-
  Training code, raw run logs, canonical analysis tables, statistical
  pipeline, and verification scripts for a 135-run study of coverage and
  within-epoch repetition in transformer grokking on modular addition,
  with the per-example dose held constant across repetition levels.
keywords:
  - grokking
  - data coverage
  - data repetition
  - data-constrained training
  - transformers
  - generalization
